[7072]="7004327F\n1\tTalk to the Lone Lady\tThe Lone Lady can be found at the Crossings of Erui. You have arrived at the Crossings of Erui and should now try to speak to the Lone Lady.\n2\tDefeat the summoned armoured wights\tThe Lone Lady's armoured wights can be found at the Crossings of Erui. The Lone Lady has summoned wights of the Kin-strife to push you from her waters. You must defeat them!\n3\tListen as Roamingstar confronts the Lone Lady\tRoamingstar is at the Crossings of the Erui. You have defeated the armoured wights and Roamingstar has arrived, filling you with hope. You should listen as she confronts her Sister.\n4\tDefeat the Lone Lady's risen armoured wights\tThe Lone Lady's armoured wights can be found at the Crossings of Erui. The Lone Lady has withdrawn in her anger and has summoned more armoured wights to drive you from the Erui. You must stand fast!\n5\tListen to the Lone Lady\tThe Lone Lady is at the Crossings of Erui. You have defeated many of the Lone Lady's armoured wights and should now listen as she speaks.\n6\tDefeat the Armour of the Usurper\tThe Armour of the Usurper is at the Crossings of Erui. The Lone Lady has taken control of Castamir's long-lost armour and now wields it in her final assault against your and her Sisters. You must defeat the Lone Lady.\n7\tObserve the meeting of the Five Sisters\tThe Five Sisters are gathered at the Crossings of Erui. You have defeated the Lone Lady and broken her madness. You should watch as her Sisters speak to her.\n8\tTalk to the Lone Lady\tThe Lone Lady is at the Crossings of Erui. You have calmed the anger of the Lone Lady and should now speak to her.\n",
})
